        <mxCell id="c130" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Reconciliations, the upper part, the matrix and the cards filtered to 2026. The matrix is one visual drawn in two panes, columns 1 to 6 and the rest after scrolling right. Outlined in coral: the JournalEntry column, which no subledger document in the extract supports, and the two differences. Total rows are not drawn. The billing and aging tables, the Findings table, the sales tax matrix and the page&#x27;s text box are in the lower part or not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="530" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
